{"code":200,"message":"OK","tweet":{"url":"https://x.com/Michaelzsguo/status/2108697102012309804","id":"2108697102012309804","text":"敏捷开发年代，“两张披萨团队”（two-pizza team）非常时髦：两张披萨够吃差不多八到十个人。\n\n到了 AI 时代，Dan Shipper 开始提出“两块披萨团队”（two-slice team）了：一两个人就够。\n\n他给这两个人安排的角色是“海盗”和“架构师”。海盗用 AI 快速尝试，不断做、不断扔，从一堆粗糙原型里找到有价值的东西；架构师再把它打磨成可靠、优雅、可以继续扩展的系统。\n\n按他的经验，一两个人已经能推进得很快，再加人，协调成本和想法分歧反而会拖慢进度。","raw_text":{"text":"敏捷开发年代，“两张披萨团队”（two-pizza team）非常时髦：两张披萨够吃差不多八到十个人。\n\n到了 AI 时代，Dan Shipper 开始提出“两块披萨团队”（two-slice team）了：一两个人就够。\n\n他给这两个人安排的角色是“海盗”和“架构师”。海盗用 AI 快速尝试，不断做、不断扔，从一堆粗糙原型里找到有价值的东西；架构师再把它打磨成可靠、优雅、可以继续扩展的系统。\n\n按他的经验，一两个人已经能推进得很快，再加人，协调成本和想法分歧反而会拖慢进度。","display_text_range":[0,240],"facets":[{"type":"media","indices":[143,166],"id":"2108696859866726400","display":"pic.x.com/QSY4jTF6nB","original":"https://t.co/QSY4jTF6nB","replacement":"https://x.com/Michaelzsguo/status/2108697102012309804/video/1"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"Michaelzsguo","url":"https://x.com/Michaelzsguo","id":"1479852652150337542","followers":9586,"following":429,"likes":5507,"media_count":2895,"name":"Michael Guo","description":"Building AI agents and AI-native orgs. Demystifying AI in practice.  EN/中文 (Selected build notes, experiments, and practical tips at the website link.)","raw_description":{"text":"Building AI agents and AI-native orgs. Demystifying AI in practice.  EN/中文 (Selected build notes, experiments, and practical tips at the website link.)","facets":[]},"location":"","banner_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1479852652150337542/1775606215","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1484637162108825608/755rQsty_200x200.jpg","joined":"Sat Jan 08 16:29:42 +0000 2022","protected":false,"website":{"url":"https://michaelguo.vercel.app/xposts.html","display_url":"michaelguo.vercel.app/xposts.html"},"verification":{"verified":true,"verified_at":null,"type":"individual"},"avatar_color":null},"replies":0,"retweets":2,"likes":10,"bookmarks":10,"quotes":0,"created_at":"Fri Oct 09 23:12:2